SUMMARY:Deadline: Est-Nord-Est Artist Residency 2027-2028 (Saint-Jean-Port-
 Joli\, Quebec)
DESCRIPTION:Est-Nord-Est offers eight-week residencies in Saint-Jean-Port-J
 oli\, Quebec\, welcoming professional visual artists\, whether established
  or emerging\, from Quebec\, Canada and other countries\, with four artist
 s per season.\n\nOrganisation: Est-Nord-Est\, residence d'artistes\nLocati
 on: Saint-Jean-Port-Joli\, Quebec\, Canada. Open to professional visual ar
 tists\, established or emerging\, from Quebec\, Canada and other countries
 \; materials\, travel and additional living expenses are the resident's ow
 n responsibility.\nAward: CAD 2\,080 residency honorarium\, plus a free in
 dividual studio-workshop with lodging\, access to specialized wood\, metal
  and ceramics equipment\, a documentation center\, and technical\, artisti
 c and logistical support. Four artists per session. No application fee.\nD
 uration: Eight weeks. Sessions: Spring 19 April - 11 June 2027\; Summer 5 
 July - 27 August 2027 (curated\, priority to artists of African descent)\;
  Fall 27 September - 19 November 2027\; Winter 24 January - 18 March 2028.
 \n\nMore: https://estnordest.org/en/artist-residency/artist-residency-regu
 lar/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
